      "line" : 463,
      "npc" : "Strange Boy",
      "text" : "Death is an inevitable step to take before rebirth."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 464,
      "npc" : "Strange Boy",
      "text" : "So I'm reborn--again, you brought me back."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 468,
      "npc" : "Strange Boy",
      "text" : "[Boy]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 469,
      "npc" : "Strange Boy",
      "text" : "All this has been arranged so that I could be reborn as God."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 473,
      "npc" : "Strange Boy",
      "text" : "[Morroc]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 474,
      "npc" : "Strange Boy",
      "text" : "That's right, you foolish humans!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 475,
      "npc" : "Strange Boy",
      "text" : "I died once, so that I could circle around the world and embrace it in my arms."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 476,
      "npc" : "Strange Boy",
      "text" : "I've been reborn to engulf this world."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 480,
      "npc" : "Strange Boy",
      "text" : "[Morroc]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 481,
      "npc" : "Strange Boy",
      "text" : "I'll create a new world and become its Creator."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 482,
      "npc" : "Strange Boy",
      "text" : "Let me ask you, the first creatures that have stepped into my newborn land."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 486,
      "npc" : "Strange Boy",
      "text" : "[Morroc]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 487,
      "npc" : "Strange Boy",
      "text" : "How'd you like to follow me and watch the birth of a new world?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 557,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 558,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "You're helpless."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 559,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "And disgusting."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 567,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 568,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "You're with a mercenary."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 569,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "Could you dismiss your current mercenary and hire me instead?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 577,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 578,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "I already assisted you once."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 579,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "Please be careful!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 586,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 587,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "{0},"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 588,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "allow me to aid you in this battle."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 592,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 593,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "My duty as the guardian isn't over yet."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 597,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "^4d4dffGuardian Nidhogg has joined your party.^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 955,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 956,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "That was a tough battle."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 957,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "This may not be good enough, but I hope it'll help your growth."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 959,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "^4d4dffGuardian Nidhogg has rewarded you with a large amount of EXP for defeating Brinaranea.^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 965,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 966,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "Can this dreadful place compete with the Frost of the Genesis?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 967,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "I can't say."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 968,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "He's created nothing on his own. How did he convince himself to think that he could be a creator?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 976,
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 977,
      "text" : "That was a tough battle."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 978,
      "text" : "This may not be good enough, but I hope it'll help your growth."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 980,
      "text" : "^4d4dffGuardian Nidhogg has rewarded you with a large amount of EXP for defeating Brinaranea.^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 995,
      "npc" : "Morroc",
      "text" : "[Morroc]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 996,
      "npc" : "Morroc",
      "text" : "You're good."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 997,
      "npc" : "Morroc",
      "text" : "Can you take on the wolf that swallowed the sun?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1000,
      "npc" : "Morroc",
      "text" : "[Morroc]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1001,
      "npc" : "Morroc",
      "text" : "If you can't handle him, then you can't handle a god now, can you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1004,
      "npc" : "Morroc",
      "text" : "[Morroc]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1005,
      "npc" : "Morroc",
      "text" : "I'll watch you. Mwa hah hah!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1404,
      "npc" : "Flowing Lava",
      "text" : "It can be used to block the flow of lava using a Frost Crystal."
