    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1431,
      "npc" : "Flowing Lava",
      "text" : "It can be used to block the flow of lava using a Frost Crystal."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 1433,
      "npc" : "Flowing Lava",
      "text" : "Use a Frost Crystal"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 1433,
      "npc" : "Flowing Lava",
      "text" : "Do not use a Frost Crystal"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1512,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1513,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "Good job, again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1514,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "This may not be good enough, but I hope it'll help your growth."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1516,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "^4d4dffGuardian Nidhogg has rewarded you with a large amount of EXP for defeating Muspellskoll.^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1522,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1523,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "Skoll... Skoll and Haati..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1524,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "Everything in here is a mere copy of that in the outside world."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1525,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "He's not a creator."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1533,
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1534,
      "text" : "Good job, again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1535,
      "text" : "This may not be good enough, but I hope it'll help your growth."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 1537,
      "text" : "^4d4dffGuardian Nidhogg has rewarded you with a large amount of EXP for defeating Muspellskoll.^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2189,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2190,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "I don't know what to say."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2191,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "We stopped the god-in-waiting."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2192,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "We accomplished our goal."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2193,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "But I'm still unnerved."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2196,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2197,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "This world is created in the mind of Morroc's."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2198,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "He'll live forever in this garden he couldn't finish."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2201,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2202,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "He probably doesn't know his body is destroyed forever."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2203,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "He was far too ambitious, even for him."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2204,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "He wanted to create a new world and become its creator,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2206,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2207,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "but he couldn't create anything on his own."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2208,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "He abandoned his Demon body, just to become a mere facsimile of an existing god."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2211,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2212,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "He took the shape of a man."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2213,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "He wasn't creative enough to reinvent the concept of God."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2214,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "He was a paradox."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2216,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2217,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "Now we need to get out of this trap in time and end; to reality."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2218,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "This world only exists in the Demon God's mind. The same day repeats forever."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2220,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2221,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "Everyone who enters this world will be dragged into the same loop."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2222,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "In that sense, he succeeded in making his own world."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2225,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2226,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "Today's despair will repeat day after day."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2227,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "Even though we know this, we'll come back to walk the same path again. I hope I'll be able to fight by you every time..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2231,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2232,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "I've talked too much. The Commander must be waiting. Let me validate your feat, so you can report to him."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2233,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "You did great today."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2250,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2251,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "...It feels like things are not over yet,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2252,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "This is very close to Morroc's spiritual world,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2253,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "He should be here to keep thinking about the past!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 2257,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "Exit."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2258,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "[Nidhogg]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2259,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "Of course. You must be exhausted."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 2260,
      "npc" : "Nidhogg",
      "text" : "Let me send you to the other members of your Expedition, free of charge."
    },
